description: "; `Coalescable[Int]` is not enough for `!`.\n\nvariant Box = Full(Int) | Empty\n\nclass Coalescable[Int] for Box {\n  fun coalesce(b: Box, rhs: Lazy[Int]) -> Int {\n    match b {\n      Box.Full(x) => { x }\n      Box.Empty => {\n        match rhs {\n          Lazy.Lazy(f) => { f() }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nfun main() {\n  let b = Box.Full(42)\n  write b!\n}\n"
